 "title": "Mug and plate",
 "summary": "The mug from the filled circle: extruded up with a slight flare, inset and pushed down for the hollow, rounded rim and base, a lip under the base, horizontal loop cuts, and a D-shaped handle made the tutor's way (extrude a 2x2 patch out, keep extruding and rotating 45 degrees so it curls down, delete the end and a lower patch, bridge the two loops), then subdivision and smooth shading. The plate from a big filled circle: insets pushed down into a broad rim, a slope and a well, the outer edge extruded down and in for the thickness, a foot ring underneath, a bevelled rim, subdivision and smooth shading.",
